-description has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Dark cocoa cookie, gooey caramel center</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"is-menu-item-price wp-block-paragraph\">$3.60</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-vertical is-content-justification-center is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-e0b91e96 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center is-menu-item-name\">Lemon Zest</h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center is-menu-item-description has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Bright citrus cookie topped with tangy lemon glaze</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"is-menu-item-price wp-block-paragraph\">$3.05</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-vertical is-content-justification-center is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-e0b91e96 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center is-menu-item-name\">Snickerdoodle</h4>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center is-menu-item-description has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Tender cookie rolled in cinnamon sugar, perfectly cozy</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"is-menu-item-price wp-block-paragraph\">$3.15</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:20px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull is-style-section-2 has-global-padding is-content-justification-center is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-c9d3b12e wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained is-style-section-2--3\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-3b811c60 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-container-core-column-is-layout-1d4cc416 wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img data-attachment-id=\"12\" data-permalink=\"https://miguelalejandrochavez-zcrxp.wordpress.com/the-golden-crumb-6a0ab271dc1d5/\" data-orig-file=\"https://miguelalejandrochavez-zcrxp.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/the-golden-crumb-6a0ab271dc1d5.png\" data-orig-size=\"864,1184\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"cookie shop\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://miguelalejandrochavez-zcrxp.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/the-golden-crumb-6a0ab271dc1d5.png?w=747\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"864\" height=\"1184\" src=\"https://miguelalejandrochavez-zcrxp.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/the-golden-crumb-6a0ab271dc1d5.png\" alt=\"An assortment of gourmet cookies arranged in a neat grid on a sheet of crisp parchment paper atop a light oak bakery counter. Each row features a different flavor: rainbow sprinkle sugar cookies, crinkled double chocolate, oatmeal raisin with visible oats, and sea-salt caramel with glossy drizzles. Soft, warm pendant lighting from above creates gentle reflections on sugary surfaces and casts delicate shadows along the parchment folds. The background fades into a creamy bokeh of shelves and jars, in photographic realism. Captured from a slightly elevated, top-down angle, the composition is clean and organized, evoking a playful yet professional cookie menu for a school project site.\" class=\"wp-image-12\" style=\"aspect-ratio:3/4;object-fit:cover\" srcset=\"https://miguelalejandrochavez-zcrxp.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/the-golden-crumb-6a0ab271dc1d5.png?allow_lossy=1 864w, https://miguelalejandrochavez-zcrxp.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/the-golden-crumb-6a0ab271dc1d5.png?w=109&amp;h=150&amp;allow_lossy=1 109w, https://miguelalejandrochavez-zcrxp.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/the-golden-crumb-6a0ab271dc1d5.png?w=219&amp;h=300&amp;allow_lossy=1 219w, https://miguelalejandrochavez-zcrxp.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/the-golden-crumb-6a0ab271dc1d5.png?w=768&amp;h=1052&amp;allow_lossy=1 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 864px) 100vw, 864px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-e6c0672a wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Take a peek behind our counter, where trays of golden cookies cool beside jars of sprinkles, chocolate chunks, and caramel bits, ready for their close‑up and waiting to be chosen as your next sweet treat.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-container-core-column-is-layout-1d4cc416 wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Fresh from the oven</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/CHWkDExpGWg?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">See how we bake our signature chocolate chip cookies — warm, golden, and ready for your next visit.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-3b811c60 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\"></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-container-core-column-is-layout-1d4cc416 wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img data-attachment-id=\"9\" data-permalink=\"https://miguelalejandrochavez-zcrxp.wordpress.com/the-golden-crumb-6a0ab27148417/\" data-orig-file=\"https://miguelalejandrochavez-zcrxp.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/the-golden-crumb-6a0ab27148417.png\" data-orig-size=\"864,1184\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"cookie shop\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://miguelalejandrochavez-zcrxp.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/the-golden-crumb-6a0ab27148417.png?w=747\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"864\" height=\"1184\" src=\"https://miguelalejandrochavez-zcrxp.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/the-golden-crumb-6a0ab27148417.png\" alt=\"A close-up of a single signature cookie called “The Golden Crumb,” thick and slightly domed with a deep golden-brown surface, crisp edges, and a soft, crackled center revealing gooey white and dark chocolate chunks. The cookie rests on a small white ceramic plate with a subtle matte finish, placed on a light linen napkin in soft mustard and cream stripes. Gentle morning sunlight streams in from the left, creating a warm glow and a tiny highlight on scattered crumbs. The background, in photographic realism, is softly blurred with hints of a wooden table and a glass cookie jar. Shot with a tight, centered composition and shallow depth of field, the atmosphere feels cozy, special, and delightfully indulgent.\" class=\"wp-image-9\" style=\"aspect-ratio:3/4;object-fit:cover\" srcset=\"https://miguelalejandrochavez-zcrxp.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/the-golden-crumb-6a0ab27148417.png?allow_lossy=1 864w, https://miguelalejandrochavez-zcrxp.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/the-golden-crumb-6a0ab27148417.png?w=109&amp;h=150&amp;allow_lossy=1 109w, https://miguelalejandrochavez-zcrxp.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/the-golden-crumb-6a0ab27148417.png?w=219&amp;h=300&amp;allow_lossy=1 219w, https://miguelalejandrochavez-zcrxp.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/the-golden-crumb-6a0ab27148417.png?w=768&amp;h=1052&amp;allow_lossy=1 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 864px) 100vw, 864px\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-global-padding is-content-justification-left is-layout-constrained wp-container-core-group-is-layout-e6c0672a wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">From gooey chocolate centers to crisp sugared edges, our cookie gallery captures each batch in all its toasty perfection, so you can almost smell the butter and vanilla through the screen.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull is-style-section-2 has-global-padding is-content-justification-center is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained is-style-section-2--4\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-